/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (A document is a representation of data stored in a Merkle Tree. The form of the document attributes is defined by the issuer. The values of the attributes are expected to be in the form of a JSON object string. The document will be most flexible when the granularity of the attributes is kept to a minimum. This allows the owner of the document to reveal only the necessary information to the verifier.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
