364 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (To issue a document, the issuer must compute the roothash of the document. Each attribute of the document is, first JSON stringified along side it's key and then hashed using the SHA-256 algorithm. Each attribute will then be computed into a string value, resulting in a JSON representation.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [12]
>>
